@startuml
title Multithreaded Data Acquisition Pipeline - Read Side Component Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2

component "Pipeline CLI\n<<external driver>>" as CLI

component "Read Side Subsystem" as ReadSide {
  portin commandPort
  portin sourcePort
  portout bufferPort

  component "ioPipelineController" as Controller
  component "ioUsbReadController\n<<producer>>" as ReadWorker
  queue "ioDataBuffer\n<<shared buffer>>" as Buffer
  component "ioFileInputByteStream" as FileInput
  component "ioFtdiByteStream" as FtdiInput

  () "pipelineLifecycle" as PipelineLifecycle
  () "readerControl" as ReaderControl
  () "ioReadableByteStream" as ReadableContract
  () "bufferWriter" as BufferWriter
}

PipelineLifecycle - Controller
ReaderControl - ReadWorker
ReadableContract - FileInput
ReadableContract - FtdiInput
BufferWriter - Buffer

CLI ..> commandPort : pipeline command
commandPort --> Controller : delegation
sourcePort --> ReadWorker : selected source
Buffer --> bufferPort : buffered bytes

Controller ..> ReaderControl : configure + start
Controller ..> ReadableContract : select input mode
ReadWorker ..> ReadableContract : read_bytes()
ReadWorker ..> BufferWriter : push() / close()

note bottom of ReadSide
This subsystem view uses ports and delegated internal
components to match UML component notation more closely.
The selected input adapter provides ioReadableByteStream.
end note
@enduml
